<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 64px', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif', background: '#F8FAFC' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 34, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #3B82F6 0%, #06B6D4 100%)', borderRadius: 3 }} />
      <Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>定位与核心闭环</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 4 }}>把「找题 — 写稿 — 改稿 — 发布」压缩进同一条链路</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 26, height: 520 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 386, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
        面向微信公众号 / 小红书 / 抖音的一站式 AI 内容生产工作台。素材库与真实热榜打底，选题、生成、适配、导出逐环相扣，创作者不必在多个工具之间反复搬运上下文。
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 8px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3B82F6' }}>3</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 2 }}>目标平台</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 8px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3B82F6' }}>5</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 2 }}>内容领域</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 8px', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3B82F6' }}>3</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 2 }}>创作风格</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(59,130,246,0.07)', border: '1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.22)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '13px 16px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
          环节之间靠 FlowContext 传递上下文：热点带着领域与建议角度进入选题，选题带着素材进入生成。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#0F172A', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 18px', marginTop: 'auto' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
          闭环即差异点：单点工具只解决一环，我们交付的是一条可演示、可度量的完整流水线。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 16, padding: '22px 20px 18px', boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(15,23,42,0.06)' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>核心闭环（计划书 T4.4 验收项）</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 4 }}>六页工作台串起五个环节，全程不切换工具</Text>
      <svg width="700" height="392" viewBox="0 0 700 392">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="gB" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0%" stopColor="#3B82F6" />
            <stop offset="100%" stopColor="#06B6D4" />
          </linearGradient>
          <marker id="arB" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="4" orient="auto">
            <path d="M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 z" fill="#3B82F6" />
          </marker>
        </defs>

        <g>
          <rect x="6" y="46" width="124" height="124" rx="14" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="#E2E8F0" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <circle cx="68" cy="78" r="16" fill="url(#gB)" />
          <text x="68" y="84" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="15" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">1</text>
          <text x="68" y="118" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="17" fontWeight="bold" fill="#0F172A">热点看板</text>
          <text x="68" y="142" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#64748B">六源真实采集</text>
        </g>
        <g>
          <rect x="150" y="46" width="124" height="124" rx="14" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="#E2E8F0" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <circle cx="212" cy="78" r="16" fill="url(#gB)" />
          <text x="212" y="84" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="15" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">2</text>
          <text x="212" y="118" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="17" fontWeight="bold" fill="#0F172A">选题列表</text>
          <text x="212" y="142" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#64748B">热点一键直传</text>
        </g>
        <g>
          <rect x="294" y="46" width="124" height="124" rx="14" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="#E2E8F0" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <circle cx="356" cy="78" r="16" fill="url(#gB)" />
          <text x="356" y="84" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="15" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">3</text>
          <text x="356" y="118" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="17" fontWeight="bold" fill="#0F172A">文案生成</text>
          <text x="356" y="142" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#64748B">RAG · ≥3 版本</text>
        </g>
        <g>
          <rect x="438" y="46" width="124" height="124" rx="14" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="#E2E8F0" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <circle cx="500" cy="78" r="16" fill="url(#gB)" />
          <text x="500" y="84" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="15" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">4</text>
          <text x="500" y="118" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="17" fontWeight="bold" fill="#0F172A">平台适配</text>
          <text x="500" y="142" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#64748B">规范硬约束</text>
        </g>
        <g>
          <rect x="572" y="46" width="116" height="124" rx="14" fill="#0F172A" stroke="#0F172A" strokeWidth="1.5" />
          <circle cx="630" cy="78" r="16" fill="url(#gB)" />
          <text x="630" y="84" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="15" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">5</text>
          <text x="630" y="118" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="17" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">导出发布</text>
          <text x="630" y="142" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#94A3B8">txt / docx</text>
        </g>

        <g stroke="#3B82F6" strokeWidth="2" fill="none">
          <path d="M132 108 L146 108" markerEnd="url(#arB)" />
          <path d="M276 108 L290 108" markerEnd="url(#arB)" />
          <path d="M420 108 L434 108" markerEnd="url(#arB)" />
          <path d="M564 108 L568 108" markerEnd="url(#arB)" />
        </g>

        <path d="M630 172 C 630 226, 68 226, 68 174" stroke="#06B6D4" strokeWidth="1.5" strokeDasharray="5 5" fill="none" />
        <text x="350" y="248" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="12.5" fill="#64748B">导出与发布数据反哺下一轮选题（闭环持续运转）</text>

        <rect x="6" y="272" width="682" height="100" rx="12" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="#E2E8F0" strokeWidth="1.2" />
        <text x="26" y="300" fontSize="13" fontWeight="bold" fill="#0F172A">闭环为什么能成立</text>
        <text x="26" y="324" fontSize="12" fill="#475569">上游每个环节都为下游产出结构化输入：热点产出领域与建议角度，选题产出素材与检索线索，</text>
        <text x="26" y="344" fontSize="12" fill="#475569">生成产出多版本候选，适配产出平台规范校验结果——没有一环是死胡同。</text>
        <text x="26" y="362" fontSize="11.5" fill="#94A3B8">对应实现：前端六页工作台 + FlowContext 跨页流转 + 后端 19 个路由</text>
      </svg>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, borderRadius: 2, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #3B82F6, #06B6D4)' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>AI 自媒体内容创作助手 · 项目汇报</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>04 / 14</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
